   "src": "abd28222a226",
   "t": "Now, now, {{mio}}-kun, calm down."
  },
  {
   "i": 1111,
   "src": "306658d6200c",
   "t": "More importantly, um..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1122,
   "src": "9868dfe05bd8",
   "t": "You're {{main}}-chan, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1139,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1148,
   "src": "4fdb21beed09",
   "t": "Yes, I'm {{main}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1151,
   "src": "00edd2bd7858",
   "t": "You're the {{exploration_club}} president."
  },
  {
   "i": 1158,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1167,
   "src": "5e7b2a36f09f",
   "t": "So you know who I am."
  },
  {
   "i": 1174,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1183,
   "src": "eccb61f5632c",
   "t": "We fought in the second round\nof the {{robattle}} Tournament."
